### **🔹 Mission Statement**  
TACF is dedicated to **providing free, open-source AI-powered content generation tools** for e-commerce businesses, digital marketers, and independent creators. Our **goal** is to make AI-driven content accessible to all, without barriers like subscription fees or licensing costs.  

TACF is built **by the community, for the community**—leveraging **collaborative development, transparency, and ethical AI practices** to support e-commerce growth worldwide.  

---

## **🚀 Business Model & Sustainability**  
Since TACF is **free and open-source**, we focus on:  

✅ **Community Development** – Crowdsourced contributions, GitHub repositories  
✅ **Open-Source API Access** – Public AI-powered tools for content generation  
✅ **Collaborations & Partnerships** – Integrations with other open-source projects  
✅ **Educational Resources** – Tutorials, documentation, and workshops  

💡 **TACF will never operate as a paywalled service**—all content generation tools, APIs, and code repositories will remain **free to use, modify, and distribute** under an open-source license.  

